<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Guides on Cribl Python SDK</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/guides/</link><description>Recent content in Guides on Cribl Python SDK</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/guides/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Getting Started</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/guides/getting-started/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/guides/getting-started/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;One &lt;code&gt;Cribl&lt;/code&gt; client covers both APIs:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;API&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Where it runs&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;SDK&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Control plane&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Your Cribl leader (&lt;code&gt;server_url&lt;/code&gt;) — on-prem or Cribl.Cloud&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;client.pipelines&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;client.sources&lt;/code&gt;, …&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Cribl.Cloud platform&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Cribl.Cloud gateway (&lt;code&gt;https://gateway.cribl.cloud&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;client.cloud.*&lt;/code&gt; — workspaces, API credentials, billing&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On Cribl.Cloud, the same &lt;code&gt;Security(client_id=..., client_secret=...)&lt;/code&gt; authenticates both. On-prem
username/password authenticates the control plane only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="install"&gt;Install&lt;a class="anchor" href="#install"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Requires &lt;strong&gt;Python 3.14&lt;/strong&gt; or later.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="book-tabs" &gt;
&lt;input type="radio" class="toggle" name="tabs-2" id="tabs-2-0" checked="checked" /&gt;&lt;label for="tabs-2-0"&gt;uv&lt;/label&gt;&lt;div class="book-tabs-content markdown-inner"&gt;
&lt;div id="uv"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
&lt;button type="button" class="code-copy" data-label="Copy" aria-label="Copy code" hidden&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;uv add cribl-python-sdk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;input type="radio" class="toggle" name="tabs-2" id="tabs-2-1" /&gt;&lt;label for="tabs-2-1"&gt;pip&lt;/label&gt;&lt;div class="book-tabs-content markdown-inner"&gt;
&lt;div id="pip"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
&lt;button type="button" class="code-copy" data-label="Copy" aria-label="Copy code" hidden&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;pip install cribl-python-sdk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;input type="radio" class="toggle" name="tabs-2" id="tabs-2-2" /&gt;&lt;label for="tabs-2-2"&gt;poetry&lt;/label&gt;&lt;div class="book-tabs-content markdown-inner"&gt;
&lt;div id="poetry"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
&lt;button type="button" class="code-copy" data-label="Copy" aria-label="Copy code" hidden&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;poetry add cribl-python-sdk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id="quickstart"&gt;Quickstart&lt;a class="anchor" href="#quickstart"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
&lt;button type="button" class="code-copy" data-label="Copy" aria-label="Copy code" hidden&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nn"&gt;cribl_python_sdk&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Cribl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Security&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;cribl&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Cribl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;server_url&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;http://localhost:9000&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;username&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;admin&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;password&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;admin&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# List pipelines (sync)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;pipelines&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;cribl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;pipelines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;list&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Async variant&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;pipelines&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;cribl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;pipelines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;list_async&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Scoped to a worker group (control plane only — not cribl.cloud.*)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;wg&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;cribl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;in_context&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;group_id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;default&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;sources&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;wg&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;sources&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;list&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;code&gt;examples/&lt;/code&gt; for more usage patterns.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>How-to</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/guides/how-to/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/guides/how-to/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="retries"&gt;Retries&lt;a class="anchor" href="#retries"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Requests are retried with exponential backoff (&lt;code&gt;backoff_factor ** attempt&lt;/code&gt; seconds), or after the
server&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code&gt;Retry-After&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;retry-after-ms&lt;/code&gt; delay when one is sent. Idempotent methods (GET, HEAD,
OPTIONS, PUT, DELETE) retry on 429, 500, 502, 503 and 504; POST and PATCH retry on 429 only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
&lt;button type="button" class="code-copy" data-label="Copy" aria-label="Copy code" hidden&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nn"&gt;cribl_python_sdk&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Cribl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;RetryConfig&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Security&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;client&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Cribl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;server_url&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://your-leader:9000&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;bearer_auth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;your-token&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;retry_config&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;RetryConfig&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;max_attempts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;backoff_factor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mf"&gt;1.5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;RetryConfig(max_attempts=1)&lt;/code&gt; disables retries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="pagination"&gt;Pagination&lt;a class="anchor" href="#pagination"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;List operations return &lt;code&gt;SDKResponse[PaginatedResponse[T]]&lt;/code&gt;. Most accept &lt;code&gt;offset&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;limit&lt;/code&gt;;
the page carries &lt;code&gt;items&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;count&lt;/code&gt; and, when the server reports it, &lt;code&gt;total_count&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Cribl.Cloud Examples</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/guides/examples-cloud/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/guides/examples-cloud/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="criblcloud-examples"&gt;Cribl.Cloud Examples&lt;a class="anchor" href="#criblcloud-examples"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;section class="example-group"&gt;
&lt;h2 id="authentication"&gt;Authentication&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class="example-list"&gt;
&lt;li data-filter="cribl.cloud oauth2 client credentials flow cribl.cloud example_cloud_auth.py"&gt;&lt;a href="../examples/authentication/cloud-auth/"&gt;Cribl.Cloud OAuth2 client credentials flow&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="badge"&gt;Cribl.Cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-filter="cribl.cloud platform authentication example validates oauth2 against the cribl.cloud gateway: health check, then list workspaces. cribl.cloud example_cloud_platform_auth.py"&gt;&lt;a href="../examples/authentication/cloud-platform-auth/"&gt;Cribl.Cloud platform authentication example&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="badge"&gt;Cribl.Cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="example-summary"&gt;Validates OAuth2 against the Cribl.Cloud gateway: health check, then list Workspaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class="example-group"&gt;
&lt;h2 id="worker-groups"&gt;Worker Groups&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class="example-list"&gt;
&lt;li data-filter="create a worker group and deploy it cribl.cloud example_cloud_create_worker_group.py"&gt;&lt;a href="../examples/worker-groups/cloud-create-worker-group/"&gt;Create a Worker Group and deploy it&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="badge"&gt;Cribl.Cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-filter="list all worker groups in cribl stream cribl.cloud example_cloud_list_worker_groups.py"&gt;&lt;a href="../examples/worker-groups/cloud-list-worker-groups/"&gt;List all Worker Groups in Cribl Stream&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="badge"&gt;Cribl.Cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-filter="replicate a worker group clone configuration from an existing group. cribl.cloud example_cloud_replicate_worker_group.py"&gt;&lt;a href="../examples/worker-groups/cloud-replicate-worker-group/"&gt;Replicate a Worker Group&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="badge"&gt;Cribl.Cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="example-summary"&gt;Clone configuration from an existing group.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-filter="scale (provision) a worker group update estimated ingest rate. cribl.cloud example_cloud_scale_worker_group.py"&gt;&lt;a href="../examples/worker-groups/cloud-scale-worker-group/"&gt;Scale (provision) a Worker Group&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="badge"&gt;Cribl.Cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="example-summary"&gt;Update estimated ingest rate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class="example-group"&gt;
&lt;h2 id="configuration"&gt;Configuration &amp;amp; Deployment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class="example-list"&gt;
&lt;li data-filter="commit and deploy configuration changes for a worker group cribl.cloud example_cloud_commit_deploy.py"&gt;&lt;a href="../examples/configuration/cloud-commit-deploy/"&gt;Commit and deploy configuration changes for a Worker Group&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="badge"&gt;Cribl.Cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-filter="configure resources create source, destination, pipeline, route in a worker group. cribl.cloud example_cloud_configure_resources.py"&gt;&lt;a href="../examples/configuration/cloud-configure-resources/"&gt;Configure Resources&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="badge"&gt;Cribl.Cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="example-summary"&gt;Create source, destination, pipeline, route in a Worker Group.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-filter="pack management example cribl.cloud example_cloud_packs.py"&gt;&lt;a href="../examples/configuration/cloud-packs/"&gt;Pack management example&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="badge"&gt;Cribl.Cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class="example-group"&gt;
&lt;h2 id="cloud-platform"&gt;Cribl.Cloud Platform&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class="example-list"&gt;
&lt;li data-filter="create a cribl.cloud api credential (organization admin) creates a new api credential with the admin role on the organization. that role cribl.cloud example_cloud_api_credential_organization_admin.py"&gt;&lt;a href="../examples/cloud-platform/cloud-api-credential-organization-admin/"&gt;Create a Cribl.Cloud API Credential (Organization Admin)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="badge"&gt;Cribl.Cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="example-summary"&gt;Creates a new API Credential with the Admin role on the Organization. That role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-filter="create a cribl.cloud api credential (organization/workspace user, product editor) creates a new api credential with: cribl.cloud example_cloud_api_credential_workspace_product_roles.py"&gt;&lt;a href="../examples/cloud-platform/cloud-api-credential-workspace-product-roles/"&gt;Create a Cribl.Cloud API Credential (Organization/Workspace User, Product Editor)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="badge"&gt;Cribl.Cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="example-summary"&gt;Creates a new API Credential with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-filter="cribl.cloud billing example prints the organization&amp;#x27;s credit balance and lists its credit grants. cribl.cloud example_cloud_billing.py"&gt;&lt;a href="../examples/cloud-platform/cloud-billing/"&gt;Cribl.Cloud billing example&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="badge"&gt;Cribl.Cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="example-summary"&gt;Prints the Organization&amp;#x27;s credit balance and lists its credit grants.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;</description></item><item><title>On-prem Examples</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/guides/examples-on-prem/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/v1/docs/guides/examples-on-prem/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="on-prem-examples"&gt;On-prem Examples&lt;a class="anchor" href="#on-prem-examples"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;section class="example-group"&gt;
&lt;h2 id="authentication"&gt;Authentication&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class="example-list"&gt;
&lt;li data-filter="on-premises login flow authenticate with username/password, then use the token. on-prem example_onprem_auth.py"&gt;&lt;a href="../examples/authentication/onprem-auth/"&gt;On-premises login flow&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="badge"&gt;On-prem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="example-summary"&gt;Authenticate with username/password, then use the token.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class="example-group"&gt;
&lt;h2 id="worker-groups"&gt;Worker Groups&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class="example-list"&gt;
&lt;li data-filter="create a worker group on an on-prem cribl instance on-prem example_onprem_create_worker_group.py"&gt;&lt;a href="../examples/worker-groups/onprem-create-worker-group/"&gt;Create a Worker Group on an on-prem Cribl instance&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class="badge"&gt;On-prem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
